        "title": "Half the distance",
        "body": "From 11 to 35 is $35 - 11 = 24$. Half of 24 is 12. The middle is $11 + 12 = 23$.\n\nCheck: $35 - 23 = 12$ too. ✓\n\n**Answer: (D) 23**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Average",
        "body": "The middle number is $(11 + 35) \\div 2 = 46 \\div 2 = 23$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 23**"
      }
